Package: clinego.app
Title: CLINE-GO Pipeline Results Viewer
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("CLINE-GO", "Team", email = "cline-go@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Interactive Shiny application for visualizing CLINE-GO
    pipeline outputs. Displays population structure, GEA/GWAS Manhattan
    plots, enrichment analyses, haplotype patterns, and maladaptation
    projections across multiple projects.
